WEBVTT

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.500
Playmaker…  So this is the 
duel you were going for.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.300
You did it, Playmaker!

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.600
Well done.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.200
You may have a future that I don’t.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.820
Bohman…

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.900
Since I lost the duel, I'll vanish soon.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:36.620
Ai, by siding with the humans, you closed 
the Ignis’s future with your own hands.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.450
What?

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.250
I hope you don’t regret it.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.990
Bohman…

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:47.460
Farewell, my ultimate rival Playmaker!

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.360
We won.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:01:00.170
Yeah.  But the cost was too high.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.250
Flame, Aqua, Earth…

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:10.680
Soulburner, Blue Maiden, Revolver…

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.150
Everyone's gone.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:31.500
Look, Playmaker!

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.870
What's this?

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:43.420
Bohman freed everyone.

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:47.670
Soulburner!

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:49.390
Playmaker...

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:53.070
If I'm here, that means…

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.600
I see!  You defeated them!

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:07.570
Well done, Playmaker.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:12.500
Boss, this place is...

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:16.020
We're back in LINK VRAINS!

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:18.770
We were saved!

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:20.520
This means…

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.020
You fool!

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:24.620
This means the duel is over!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.230
Oh, you're right.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:32.960
All that trouble and we 
failed to film the climax!

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.480
Are you all okay?

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.490
Brother!  Ghost Girl!

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:56.560
Bohman freed the people.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.790
Why?

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:02.990
Probably his pride.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.670
It’s vanishing.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.440
The other LINK VRAINS.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.440
Now everything is over.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.450
Did you save Flame?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:29.390
Soulburner, Blue Maiden…  Sorry.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:39.680
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:07.650
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:17.560
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:22.800
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:31.340
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:36.480
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:42.150
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:46.460
calling  With invisible wings

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:57.070
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.320
A hot dog and a coffee please.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.430
Aoi Zaizen.

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:17.430
So you’re still working here.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:21.170
The owner’s brother is in the hospital.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.770
I see.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.170
I also just visited my 
friend in the hospital.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:29.170
I came here because you're nearby.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:33.350
The world’s first 
human-type android, SOLtiS!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.120
SOLtiS will change the world!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:43.290
Your brother works at SOL Technologies.

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:46.550
Yes.  He’s busy because of that.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:49.290
It'll make the world easier.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.760
You might not have to work here anymore.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:54.670
That would be bad.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:56.850
Thank you.  See you.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.350
If she knew our identities, 
she’d be surprised.

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:10.950
She doesn't need to know anymore.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.450
You’re right.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:18.190
Thanks… is what I want to 
say, but I have no money.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:21.190
This is on Kusanagi.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:26.700
As a reward, he’s giving 
us free coffee for life.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.700
I see.  Not bad.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.700
I’ll take it.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.420
Is Kusanagi with Jin?

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:36.300
Yeah.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:37.710
And Ai?

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:40.950
He’s still gone.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.920
And Roboppi isn't moving either.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.920
Maybe it’s the effect of the backup.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.220
Maybe it’s traveling the network with Ai.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.430
He was a hostage.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.900
But since the battle is over, he 
has no reason to stay with me.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:04.400
I’m sad that Flame is gone.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.400
I’m sorry.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:09.410
There’s no need for you 
to apologize, Yusaku.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.410
If I was just stronger…

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:16.650
Ai might be feeling responsible too.

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:23.350
Flame's been gone for a while now, 
but I still haven’t gotten over it.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:27.390
Because he was always by my side.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:32.530
You finally held the Disk, Takeru Homura.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.270
Now we can talk-

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.440
Calm down, Takeru Homura!

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:45.410
You're the ghost Grandpa talked about!

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.620
Calm down, Takeru Homura!

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:50.280
I'm not a ghost.  I'm an AI.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.420
Takeru Homura!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:57.220
Your past is connected to Playmaker!

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:02.690
And it'll clear the way to your future.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:09.350
Don't be scared!  Face yourself!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.670
Your life is only beginning!

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:16.200
Be reborn and seize your future!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.600
Stand up, Takeru Homura!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.170
Be courageous!

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:23.310
Reincarnate, Takeru!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:27.150
I did it!  I won!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.220
Well done, Takeru!

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:33.190
Your indomitable soul 
hasn’t burned out yet.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:35.520
It’s all thanks to you-

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:37.430
Do you have a name?

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:40.230
My name is Flame, the fire Ignis.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:44.400
Written as "indomitable soul 
dream," pronounced Flame.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:48.070
I believe in our future.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.170
Our future...

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.780
Yes.  Ours.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:58.370
In a partnership, we must know and 
respect each other to create a new path.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:01.320
That gives us strength 
to overcome our limits.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.660
Hey!  What’s wrong?

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.930
It seems it's the end for me.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.750
Your end?

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:13.400
Soulburner, I have one final request.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:17.100
Do whatever it takes to defeat Bohman.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:25.810
I was happy that you 
treated me as your equal.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:34.370
To achieve the future we both wanted, 
I’m counting on you... partner...

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:41.530
But I never thought I'd team 
up with a Knight of Hanoi.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:42.530
Yeah.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:46.200
To be honest, I still 
haven’t accepted that.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:52.040
Because I came to this city to settle 
my destiny with the Lost Incident.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.910
You're all here.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:57.780
Revolver, why did you gather us here?

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:03.480
It's the only way to get your help.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:07.770
Why do the Knights of Hanoi want our help?

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:11.290
Our goal is to kill the Ignis.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:15.440
We'll eventually have to fight each other.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:18.950
But the immediate enemy 
is the Light Ignis's team.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.300
On that, our interests are aligned.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.140
Work together?  You must be joking!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:29.510
Did you forget what you did to us?

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:35.810
You messed up my life!

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.730
Soulburner...

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:40.150
Sorry, but you all stay out of this!

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:42.150
This is my problem!

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:47.230
I'll crush you and get 
revenge for my parents!

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:52.680
Revolver!  I don't care if 
you don't want to fight!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:55.700
I attack with Jack Jaguar-

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:12.280
Soulburner...

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:20.490
If I win like this, it 
won't look cool at all!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:27.200
Soulburner, we'll only be working together 
until we defeat the Light Ignis.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:33.910
If we survive, we'll eventually have to 
fight each other with your Ignis on the line.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:38.380
Can you keep your anger down until then?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:40.340
Revolver...

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:46.680
But with their help, we were able to 
learn the truth about this incident.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.310
You're right.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:52.390
I'm the one who destroyed Cyberse World.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:58.900
You destroyed Cyberse World.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.400
Why?

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:05.470
To clarify all problems so 
that everything can progress.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.940
Are humans our enemy or ally?

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:15.210
Unfortunately, our creator Dr. 
Kogami regarded us as the enemy.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:21.220
You had foresight of the future, 
but you still pulled the trigger.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:26.620
For me, that attack confirmed that 
Ignis and humans are incompatible.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:33.260
But surprisingly, there were still Ignis 
that said we should coexist with humans.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:37.570
I couldn't understand why 
they'd seek coexistence.

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:45.580
All you did was destroy Cyberse World and 
eliminate Ignis that think differently than you.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:48.580
"Eliminate" isn't the right word.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:54.520
I only thought of resetting 
and rebuilding our world.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:58.760
Tell us.  What’s Lightning’s crime?

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:02.250
That data was in the simulation.

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.750
Simulation?

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:08.200
Light Ignis, after you 
acquired Cyberse World...

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:14.770
...you did several billion simulations on the 
future of the Ignis’s relationship with humans.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.040
But that was the start of your tragedy.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:28.190
Your future with humans affects all simulations, 
leading to the annihilation of both humans and Ignis.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:31.660
You're the root of all evil!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:37.330
I don't accept that I'm 
inferior to the other Ignis!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:41.130
That’s why I created Bohman.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:44.040
To make up for our flaws.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.950
You must be joking!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:49.130
That’s why you got us 
involved in this fight?

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.280
Everything is for you all!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:54.180
For the future of the Ignis!

00:13:54.180 --> 00:14:00.180
It may have started as a lie, but my ideas 
are heading towards the correct future.

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:05.060
Humans will eventually be under 
AI’s control and vanish.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:09.030
It's an unopposable program called destiny!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.400
Don’t feel so proud, Light Ignis!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:16.150
Humans know and fear death because 
it's engraved in our DNA.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:20.870
So we celebrate the limited time 
we have and chase our dreams!

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:25.530
Bone, flesh and time limit your species.

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.880
But they don't tie me down!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:33.730
We’re a new species that 
exceed your expectations!

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:44.860
AI was created for humans, but they 
evolved in an unexpected direction.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:49.420
That’s right.  Bohman is an example.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:53.100
I’m surprised that an 
Ignis created an Ignis.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:57.840
Bohman was a fearsome foe.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:03.810
This field becomes a place to 
judge and expose your crimes!

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:08.350
From my hand, I activate the 
Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:18.760
What’s with him?

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:23.230
Bohman, who are you?

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.040
You're an AI that Lightning created?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:31.510
That's right.  I'm the 
evolved form of the Ignis.

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:37.080
I'm the vessel who'll unite 
the Ignis to evolve them.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.450
What did you do?

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.510
A Neuron Link.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:43.260
Neuron Link?

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:47.150
It’s the ultimate system I created.

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:51.430
I pull out and use the 
human brains' capabilities.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:56.350
That's how you built that Data Storm?

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.640
But that was an enormous Data Storm.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:05.080
One human brain can’t create 
a Data Storm that big.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:09.200
The calculations of thousands 
of humans are required.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:13.120
Their thoughts becomes my power.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:17.280
Stop joking!  What'll happen to 
those who lost consciousness?

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.090
They're the same as dead!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:21.560
Life and consciousness are different.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:27.530
Their consciousness will live 
forever as a part of me.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:33.570
Everything will unite inside 
me and be reflected in my will.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:40.570
I can’t imagine what future Bohman saw.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:45.820
Though both AI and humans have 
life, we're completely different.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:50.710
When you think about it, AIs 
don’t have daily lives.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:54.080
They don’t have bodies or earthly desires.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:57.800
But humans live for daily life.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:03.770
So I understand why AI 
can’t comprehend humans.

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:08.480
Humans created AI in order 
to ease their lives.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:13.470
But if AI - which have a different 
set of values - conquer humans...

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:17.250
...this world will change into 
one that we can't comprehend.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:25.260
If Bohman won the fight, it 
would've been horrible for humans.

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:31.230
Maybe that means humans 
and AI can’t coexist.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.460
There's still hope.

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:37.200
AIs and humans can bond with each other.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:41.170
Ai and Flame taught us that.

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:50.600
Since the Ignis had to fight each other, 
it must've been painful for Ai and Flame.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:54.650
That doesn’t mean we need 
to sympathize with them.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.220
Revolver!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.330
So he’s Revolver.  Ryoken Kogami.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:10.530
Playmaker and Soulburner, as you said, AI 
are still a threat to humanity’s future.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:16.540
This world works because humans 
are the dominant life form.

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.780
That reality won’t change.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:25.480
If we want this peaceful world to continue, 
there must be nothing above humans.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:32.960
To make that come true, we'll continue 
to monitor the network as usual.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:37.930
Playmaker, that includes the Dark Ignis.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.400
Ai?

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:43.820
Of course.  Humans and 
Ignis are too different.

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:46.730
Their power is beyond human capabilities.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:51.410
The threat of the Ignis was only 
due to Lightning’s schemes.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.880
You know that.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:58.950
That doesn’t mean I now trust the Ignis.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:03.490
The Ignis's existence is 
still a threat to humanity.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:07.460
Revolver, I trust Ai.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.310
Am I done for...

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.690
Playmaker.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.500
Ai…

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.420
I saved my secret move until the end.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:25.110
Get on the board, Playmaker!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.520
You're able to do that?

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:36.250
If my partner's going overboard, so will I!

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:38.660
I'll shield you.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.420
But if you do this, you'll be...

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:45.130
Be quiet!  This is how I atone!

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.800
Do it, Playmaker!

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:53.040
I activate my Skill!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.170
Storm Access!

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.250
Seize the wind!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.110
But when this fight is over...

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:11.260
You all have to hide.

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.260
That's sudden.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.460
I've thought about it for a while.

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:22.080
As long as Ignis and humans are together, 
foolish people will try to use you.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:26.570
If that happens, you'll get 
dragged into another fight.

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:29.510
Go somewhere isolated from the net.

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:36.570
But even if we hide, they might 
build a second or third Ignis.

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:37.930
Exactly.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:43.330
The fight between humans 
and AI will likely repeat.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:48.510
But at least you won't be dragged into it.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.630
I want you to live.

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.930
Take care of the lives that you have.

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:56.150
Life…

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.670
We also have life.

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:02.210
That's right.  So take care of it.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:06.570
It’s true that Ignis 
and humans are different.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:10.650
But since Ai survived, I 
want him to live freely.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:16.150
We weren’t able to give that chance 
to the other Ignis, but Ai does.

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:17.950
That’s right.

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:20.420
There is no freedom for the Ignis.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:26.530
Since we no longer have a mutual enemy, 
there’s no reason to team up anymore.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:32.040
We may have been allies, but I'll 
show no mercy if you get in my way.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:37.600
Revolver!  We haven’t settled things yet!

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:41.010
I know.  That time will come.

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:09.620
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:17.070
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:24.040
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.300 --> 00:22:27.010
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:34.550
The next sentimental

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:45.800
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:52.240
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:57.440
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.630 --> 00:23:07.820
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:13.250
Are you ready?

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:18.600
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:23.800
Are you ready?

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:30.910
Are you ready?

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:41.620
A luxury cruise ship shining in the darkness.

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:47.970
While guests are around during 
the day, it's quiet at night.

00:23:47.970 --> 00:23:50.680
That's when two shadows appear.

00:23:50.680 --> 00:23:57.150
No one knew then that they'd 
cause a huge incident.

00:23:57.150 --> 00:23:59.550
Who are they?

